wl , NCAA men 's Division I basketball Final Four and Major League Baseball ( MLB ) All - Star Game . ","R3S5":"The Final Four was played at the Alamodome in San Antonio and the MLB All - Star Game was also played in Houston at nearby Minute Maid Park ."}},{"passage_title":"nq_p_0237087","evidence_units":{"R4S1":"In 2017 , Houston hosted Super Bowl LI . ","R4S2":"This is the third Super Bowl for the city , with the previous games being held in 1974 and 2004 ."}},{"passage_title":"nq_p_0605696","evidence_units":{"R5S1":"Super Bowl IV , the fourth and final AFL - NFL World Championship Game in professional American football , was played on January 11 , 1970 , at Tulane Stadium in New Orleans , Louisiana . ","R5S2":"The American Football League ( AFL ) champion Kansas City Chiefs defeated the National Football League ( NFL ) champion Minnesota Vikings by the score of 23 -- 7 . ","R5S3":"This victory by the AFL squared the Super Bowl series with the NFL at two games apiece . ","R5S4":"The two leagues merged into one after the season ."}}],"near_duplicate_passages":[]}
